# Note     : Wolfram LSystem interprets every non-control symbol as draw-forward; the exact drawing alphabet here is: F.
#
# Original Wolfram Function Repository LSystem:
# WOLFRAM-FUNCTION-R | ResourceFunction["LSystem"][{"F" -> "FF-F-F-F-F-F+F"}, "F-F-F-F", 4, 90]
